n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}3 & -1 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -3 & -2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}0 & 3 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 4 & -2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ -3 & -2\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}7 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -3 & 9 \\\\ -8 & -11 & 34 \\\\ -5 & -7 & 21\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n*Step 3:*\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 3 & 9 \\\\ 8 & -11 & -34 \\\\ -5 & 7 & 21\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 4:*\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 3 & -11 & 7 \\\\ 9 & -34 & 21\\text{ }\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 5:*\n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{det(A)}{C}^{T}=\\frac{1}{1}[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 3 & -11 & 7 \\\\ 9 & -34 & 21\\text{ }\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 3 & -11 & 7 \\\\ 9 & -34 & 21\\text{ }\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}-18 \\\\ 25 \\\\ 77\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence the solution is $x=-18,\\,y=25,\\,z=77.$" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356175 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356176 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356177 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356178 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356179 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1041 "selection" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356179 13194139535585 true] [17592186356174 1110 #uuid "277eb88c-abd3-566e-bb51-1ac538dd4326" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356175 1034 "x=-