fficient matrix:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-z=0 \\\\ x+y+3z=2 \\\\ 3x-2y+z=4\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356187 1113 #uuid "be5a9299-0f7a-5c96-82dc-a78e4b6223ee" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356187 1145 "We wish to write this system in the form $Ax=b$, where $A$ is a $3\\times 3$ matrix and $x$ and $b$ are $3\\times 1$ column vectors. We can do this as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, the solution to $Ax=b$ is given by $x={A}^{-1}b.$ So, we compute ${A}^{-1}$ as follows:\n\n*Step 1:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(A) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}|-0|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1(1-3(-2))+0-1(-2-3) \\\\  & =1+6+2+3 \\\\  & =12.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n*Step 2:*\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =[\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 3 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}| & |\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & -8 & -5 \\\\ -2 & 4 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n*Step 3:*\n\n$$\nC=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 8 & -5 \\\\ 2 & 4 & 2 \\\\ 1 & -4 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 4:*\n\n$$\n{C}^{T}=[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 8 & 4 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n*Step 5:*\n\n$$\n{A}^{-1}=\\frac{1}{det(A)}{C}^{T}=\\frac{1}{12}[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 8 & 4 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nHence\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & ={A}^{-1}b \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}[\\begin{aligned}7 & 2 & 1 \\\\ 8 & 4 & -4 \\\\ -5 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}[\\begin{aligned}8 \\\\ -8 \\\\ 8\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ -\\frac{2}{3} \\\\ \\frac{2}{3}\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nHence the solution is $x=\\frac{2}{3},y=-\\frac{2}{3},z=\\frac{2}{3}.$" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356189 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356190 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356191 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356192 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1000 #edb/ref 17592186356193 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1041 "selection" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1104 #edb/ref 17592186356190 13194139535585 true] [17592186356188 1110 #uuid "85c5d548-84fe-5350-99f6-9a31c34161f9" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356189 1034 "x=8,y=-8,z=8" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356189 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535585 true] [17592186356189 1111 #uuid "e5bcc481-cc80-53ab-8ada-8994bcf2f6bb" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356190 1034 "x=\\frac{2}{3},y=-\\frac{2}{3},z=\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356190 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535585 true] [17592186356190 1111 #uuid "cf8bca25-b939-5f03-8ddd-08ff31f525ea" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356191 1034 "x=-\\frac{2}{3},y=-\\frac{2}{3},z=-\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356191 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535585 true] [17592186356191 1111 #uuid "131e9eab-c9d9-5aa4-a89a-05bb7f068efb" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356192 1034 "x=\\frac{2}{3},y=\\frac{2}{3},z=\\frac{2}{3}" 13194139535585 true] [17592186356192 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535585 true] [17592186356192 1111 #uu